## GAIA benchmark

The questions this agent answers come from the GAIA benchmark, served by the evaluation
API of the Hugging Face Agents Course. The dataset and its answer key belong to the GAIA
authors and are NOT redistributed here: no answer key file is versioned, and the local
benchmark (`npm run score`) reads the answer key from an external path given in
`GROUND_TRUTH_PATH`.

Mialon et al. "GAIA: a benchmark for General AI Assistants" (2023).
https://huggingface.co/datasets/gaia-benchmark/GAIA

